      "transcript_text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like plantar fasciitis, but I'd like to confirm. I'd like to arrange an X-ray of the foot for heel pain. Roll the sole over a bottle and stretch the calf against a wall twice a day. Supportive shoes with a cushioned heel help. I'll want another look in six weeks. Call the clinic if you need us.",
